[node name="Lighting" type="Node3D" unique_id=1838254414]
editor_description = "Global light for every map. A raking sun from the west-south-west for readable shadows and relief; sky ambient so shadowed sides take a cool tint; AgX tone mapping so snow and pale buildings do not burn out; ambient occlusion to seat units and buildings on the ground; glow only above 1.3 so only emissive flashes and lamps bloom. No depth fog: the camera is orthographic, so it would tint the whole screen evenly."

